{"server":"cn","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_04_end","groupId":"act41side","stageId":"act41side_04","title":"旧舞步","storyCode":"EA-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"b7fab34a806a3ab0b829c14d1bcb2a2449a5d449bd47eb3cbecf45e90a7f6b09","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"雕像燃烧的广场上，过去与现在的舞约重叠，爱布拉娜与拉芙希妮隔着已逝的英雄对峙。一切结束后，拉芙希妮受到托付，带逝者离开纳斯尔纱，前往遗迹。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>高傲的红龙没有朋友，只会偶尔和镜子里的自己聊聊天。</i>\n<i>有一年的夏末节，她要举办一场盛大的宴会，需要镜中人出来帮忙，但她们两个不能同时出现在别人面前，否则镜中人就会消失。</i>\n<i>镜中人不得不遵循红龙的命令，出发去邀请神秘的守灵人。守灵人却无论如何也不愿赴宴，还劝镜中人不要再回去。</i>\n<i>但镜中人仍然只身回到红龙的巢穴。此时宴会已经开始，镜中人连忙躲进篝火外的黑暗。</i>\n<i>不知不觉中，来赴宴的人一个个消失，而红龙硬是把镜中人从黑暗中拉出来，强迫她和自己跳舞。</i>\n<i>她们跳啊跳，跳啊跳，镜中人觉得自己的脚趾都要掉了，她想休息一会儿，红龙却无论如何也不肯停下来。</i>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"给，拉芙希妮。\n你要的书，蒸汽骑士冒险故事的续集。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"你问我，“为什么”？\n这不需要理由，我亲爱的妹妹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是，你真的需要读它吗？\n读一本要不是迫于同龄人的压力，你其实根本就不感兴趣的书？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我自己想看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是对父亲说过的吗，你不想被其他人问，为什么会有维多利亚人不喜欢看蒸汽骑士的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这本书......是爸爸让你帮我买的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你......为什么会知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在后退，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜欢你像其他人一样畏惧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你这么害怕被我知道这些，不如来跟我跳一支舞，缓解一下紧张，如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是......跳舞吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不可以是呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说着，爱布拉娜甚至优雅地朝妹妹伸出手。\n但在拉芙希妮的印象里，即便在父母放起一家人都喜欢的音乐，父亲摇头晃脑，母亲用手指在桌上敲着节拍的时候......\n姐姐都只是冷冷地笑着，端坐在原位。\n她从未跟着音乐舞动过身体。一次都没有过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_1685_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你能跟上我脚步的时候，你就不必再为一本书、一个请求，或是几个同龄的朋友烦忧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"还没拆封的骑士小说掉在地上，新书好闻的气味被泥水掩没。\n她还太小，她没想过如愿以偿也能如此沉重苦涩，她只记得自己踉跄着转身离开，没有握住那只伸向自己的......\n柔软而冰冷的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人群已经散去，不必再隐藏自己的身份了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你仍然觉得他们还活着吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，每个塔拉人心中都燃烧着这样的火。从我们的先祖向维多利亚人俯首开始，火就从未熄灭过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城里的人如此，那些随我回来的人们，他们也是一样，只是他们的火从未染上死亡的颜色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错的比喻，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，我现在再来问问你吧，你要怎么办呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再去把那团火漆成你的颜色？我想你一定已经试过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是谁，一旦沾染了死亡，你的火焰就只能将其化为灰烬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，拉芙希妮，杀死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同时杀死城里的所有人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的这么在意一件事会如何被记述，你也可以说，是我杀了他们，你只是把他们埋葬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纳斯尔纱的人们还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕驱动那具身体的已经只剩死亡，而非生命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的连一点生命的火种都不存在，他们早就变成你那些游荡、无知无识的行尸了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们早晚会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他们不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我宁愿将活人身上的紫火看作一场瘟疫，一场因你而起的瘟疫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你要去给这场瘟疫寻找解药了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望那解药能让你也一并痊愈，爱布拉娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真......好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，真好，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己还没注意到吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经在想如何治愈我，而不是如何逃避我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来跳舞吧，拉芙希妮。跳那支我一直想邀你一起，你却总是逃开的舞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你说......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我说，来跳舞吧，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在最后一个小节之前，用你的枪贯穿我的心脏。致死的瘟疫没有解药，你的意志足够坚定，你的行动却终将只是徒劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来吧，别再逃避宿命了......纳斯尔纱的，还有我们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夏末节还没到，但生与死之间的界限已经比塔拉历史上的任何时刻都要模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的想让塔拉变成死的国度吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉芙希妮下意识地转过头去。\n炽烈的紫火仍在英雄一路拖行至此的骨架上熊熊燃烧，而刚刚被紫火占据，猛地站起的库林的身体，此刻也跪倒在地。\n她不忍再看，于是回过头，直视姐姐的双眼，和那只时隔多年重新伸给自己的手。\n不知是错觉，还是紫火笼罩下的一切都会失去生机，相比记忆之中，她眼前那只手白得毫无血色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是一座城市，这是无数人的生命。爱布拉娜，这不是能用宿命两个字轻飘飘地概括的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说完了吗？我觉得我们已经在各自的频道讲得够久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......爱布拉娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你大可以继续长篇大论下去，反正只要你想，我就会站在这里等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是快些，拉芙希妮。你终究是等得起的，其他人却未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（深呼吸）你说得对，你终究是等得起的，但其他人却未必。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好，这场舞我陪你跳，直到我们中有一个倒地不起为止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我不会按你的舞步来。决不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"悉听尊便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是有一件事你会错意了，亲爱的拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个等不起的人，此刻就站在你面前呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"等不起？\n拉芙希妮紧紧盯着姐姐的脸庞，她突然意识到一件彻头彻尾离题的事情。\n那只手的苍白并非错觉。\n紫火几乎编织成一张铺天盖地的披风，让爱布拉娜显得美丽而可怖，却也无法掩饰她皮肤里透出的，如同消耗性的恶疾作祟一样的惨白。\n她不该是这样的，她从没像这样过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爱布拉娜，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐，你......还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爱布拉娜脸上泛起笑意。那笑总挂在她的脸上，冷冰冰的。\n此刻那笑容仿佛有了些温度，却更显得那惨白的脸触目惊心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢关心，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这些冷漠的别离与苦楚的团聚之后，能听见你的问候，也真的是......久违了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，我倒也确实想和你跳一场舞，拉芙希妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......等我找到治好你的方法，我会和你跳的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"爱布拉娜","speakerId":"avg_450_necras_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，我会在这里等着的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"爱布拉娜信步走向堡垒，那脚步声飘渺到虚弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......红龙！涅梅丝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我到城门的时候，那里一个人都没有！我知道一定是出了什么事，广场上到底——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"红龙，这......是？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拉芙希妮怀中抱着一个小小的匣子。在夜间昏暗的灯光下，似乎什么都比平日更加模糊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我救不了库林，只能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只能以这种方式给他安息，让他不必继续在广场上受死火的煎熬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"游牧人沉默了半晌，在地上摸索到一枚石头。\n她铆足浑身的力气，将那枚石头狠狠砸向堡垒的方向。\n但那石头旋即被夜里的黑暗吞没，甚至没有发出一丝声响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宵禁已经开始了。涅梅丝、布莉吉，我们先——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"涅梅丝伸手从木匣上方虚虚拂过，似乎试图擦去一些不存在的灰尘。\n她忽然想起几天前，自己被原本的同族拒绝时，那人对自己说的一些多余的话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g5_remains_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守灵人不和生者团结，也不需要生者的尊重，除非他们已经死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这才是深池理当尊重的传统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，多谢您还愿意给我这枚哨笛......我回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，涅梅丝。你明知道夏末节将至，守灵人不太可能拿得出什么祭器，但你还是来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些深池强迫你来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我自己——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅丝，你的性格还真是一点没变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等待、斡旋、调和......你在纳斯尔纱，在那条红龙的麾下，也执着于这样吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......不希望看到本该向好的情况恶化，本该同心协力的人起冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如冲突本就无法避免，你只会在其中越陷越深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的守灵人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1691_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市将你浸染得黯淡了，涅梅丝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以领袖——红龙——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，爱布拉娜是不会给纳斯尔纱带来真正的生活的，对吗，拉芙希妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说她做不到。她......其实并不喜欢撒谎，除非另有制约......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已经是整个塔拉的领袖，独一无二的红龙，还有什么能制约她？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅丝，你怎么了？你看起来......不对劲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。拉芙希妮殿下，我突然明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来那火的确是会侵染活人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"涅梅丝？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经依赖的人们，原来是一群中饱私囊的蛀虫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经信仰的领袖，原来是一条目无他人生死的恶龙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾经不惜性命捍卫的人们......我的挚友为他们而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至，如果不是那条恶龙用紫火将他点燃，我都不知道他们还会对他做些什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"库林问得对，等到夏末节过去，我该做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了复仇，我没有什么可做的了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这句话说出口之后，拉芙希妮看见，最后一名还未沾染紫火的纳斯尔纱居民，她身上燃起了火焰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉芙希妮殿下，您会因此将我当成城里人的同类，爱布拉娜的仆臣吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是这致死的恶疾......终于传染到了最后一个城里人身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，拉芙希妮殿下，我发誓，我会协助您把这支强加给您的舞一直跳下去，一直跳下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到那条邪恶的红龙倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我听见了你的誓言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我得离开纳斯尔纱一趟。跟我一起走吧，涅梅丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守灵人的聚落，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。城里已经没有治愈那火焰的希望，我得去找到任何可能帮得上忙的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不会去。我已经没有资格回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会在城市里待下去。只要没被红龙注意到，没被她撕成碎片......我会努力不让事态继续恶化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这枚哨笛麻烦您还回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......库林也拜托您了。请您给库林一个真正的葬礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葬礼上需要亲友念诵悼词，我......我写一份，您帮我念，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"59_g4_dragonsquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了。给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我陪苇草一起离开。黑林现在不放任何人出入，我们两个人，或许会顺利一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，布莉吉，你得留下，我需要你的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苇草？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉芙希妮","speakerId":"avg_1020_reed2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一个人没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布莉吉","speakerId":"avg_4177_brigid_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也可以，可......涅梅丝，你越来越不像你自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"涅梅丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_1692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许这就是复仇会把人变成的样子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
